ed with ocular ischemia syndrome;\n-  Age-related macular degeneration group (Control group): Patients diagnosed with age-related macular degeneration;\n-  Age: 50-80 years;\n-  Sex: all;\n-  Patients signed written informed consent.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Ocular ischemia syndrome group: Patients diagnosed with ocular ischemia syndrome;",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "ocular ischemia syndrome"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "ocular ischemia syndrome"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Age-related macular degeneration group (Control group): Patients diagnosed with age-related macular degeneration;",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "age-related macular degeneration"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "age-related macular degeneration"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- Age: 50-80 years;",\n              "Age": [\n                "Age"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                "years"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Value": [\n                "50",\n                "80"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "50-80 years"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                "-"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Sex: all;",\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            "-"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- Patients signed written informed consent.",\n      "Eq-Operator": [\n        "-"\n      ]\n    }